there are you sort of end up in the shadow

00:43:28.347 --> 00:43:29.263
and you're diminished.

00:43:30.947 --> 00:43:31.780
And so, and I wonder if there's a way

00:43:31.780 --> 00:43:33.170
you could tease that out

00:43:33.170 --> 00:43:35.460
in looking at these at these surveys

00:43:35.460 --> 00:43:39.110
if there are questions that
might make give you priors

00:43:39.110 --> 00:43:40.630
