00:43:43.480 --> 00:43:47.030
or something like that, to
kind of get a sense that maybe,

00:43:47.030 --> 00:43:49.493
maybe there affects
working in both directions,

00:43:50.690 --> 00:43:54.270
but the other question that
has more of a methological one,

00:43:54.270 --> 00:43:59.270
and that's, I love this natural
experiment of did the visit.

00:44:00.810 --> 00:44:02.950
I'm sorry, did this survey
response happened before

00:44:02.950 --> 00:44:05.530
or after the visit started?

00:44:05.530 --> 00:44:06.810
But I wonder if that's actually,

00:44:06.810 --> 00:44:08.780
