of invite later visits

00:46:23.360 --> 00:46:26.510
when they feel weakened or
they feel like, you know,

00:46:26.510 --> 00:46:29.020
their hold on power is tenuous.

00:46:29.020 --> 00:46:30.980
And I just wonder if it was worth thinking

00:46:30.980 --> 00:46:35.200
about whether there's any
causal pathway potentially there

00:46:35.200 --> 00:46:36.870
between the need for a visit

00:46:36.870 --> 00:46:39.820
and on the part of the
host country and attitudes

00:46:39.820 --> 00:46:43.020
in that host country
toward the sending country.

00:46:43.020 --> 00:46:44.630
So that's my first point.

00:46:44.630 --> 00:46:47.533
And in the second point
