00:46:48.650 --> 00:46:51.340
I was expecting the
question to be sort of more

00:46:51.340 --> 00:46:54.540
about the favor ability of
the country or the favor,

00:46:54.540 --> 00:46:57.390
sorry the attitudes toward the country

00:46:57.390 --> 00:46:59.420
